@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Assembler pipeline and consumers

top to bottom direction

component "Source text" as Source
component "Line parser" as Parser
component "ISA catalog" as ISA
component "Statements" as Statements
component "Pass 1\nLayout and symbols" as Pass1
component "Pass 2\nByte emission" as Pass2
component "Value evaluator\n(opaque service)" as Values
component "CodeMemory\nSparse bytes" as Memory
component "AssemblyInfo\nDiagnostics, symbols,\nrelocations, source map" as Info
component "SIC/XE loader" as Runtime
component "Language service" as Language

Source --> Parser
ISA --> Parser
Parser --> Statements
Statements --> Pass1
Pass1 --> Pass2
Values --> Pass1
Values --> Pass2
Pass1 --> Info
Pass2 --> Memory
Pass2 --> Info
Memory --> Runtime
Info --> Runtime
Info --> Language

note right of Values
  Expression parsing and
  evaluation internals are
  outside this diagram's scope.
end note

note bottom of Info
  Runtime consumes image and
  execution metadata. The language
  service uses analysis metadata.
end note
@enduml
